      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LIIII} Gif hwa binnan þam gemærum ures rices reaflác ⁊ niednæme dó, agife he ðone reaflac ⁊ geselle LX sciƚƚ to wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone within the boundaries of our kingdom commits robbery and forceful plunder, let him return the plunder and give 60 shillings as a fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone within the borders of our kingdom commits an act of robbery or seizes anything with violence, he shall restore the plunder and pay a fine of 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa reaflac ⁊ nydnæme binnan þam gemærum ures rices gedó, agife he ðone reaflac ⁊ gesylle LX scll' to wite.</ab>
      </div>
